flowchart TD
    A[Review HallPass Requirements, User Stories, and MVP Features] --> B[Identify Critical Assumptions]
    B --> C[Select MVP Experiment Type]
    C --> D[Define Target Test Users]
    D --> E[Prepare Five-Task Experiment Script]
    E --> F[Run HallPass MVP Test]
    F --> G[Record Experiment Results]
    G --> H[Collect Tester Feedback]
    H --> I[Measure Results Against Success Metrics]
    I --> J{Do Results Meet the Targets?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Continue to Implementation Sprint]
    J -->|Some Metrics Fail| L[Revise Interface, Navigation, Labels, or Feature Priority]
    J -->|Most Metrics Fail| M[Revisit Requirements, User Stories, Critical Assumptions, and Problem Evidence]
